-    *   **Input:** Initial density representations of neighbors $\sigma^0_{i-n}, \dots, \sigma^0_{i+n}$ plus positional encodings: $D_0 = [\sigma^0_{i-n}; \dots; \sigma^0_{i+n}] + E_{pos}$.
